{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《美食新聞報道》帶大家吃盡中西好滋味！節目首先由食評家 Agnes 與施焯日（Arthur）帶路，深入尖沙咀的一間名人飯堂，品嚐正宗避風塘菜式；隨後再跟著倪嘉雯（Carmen）與伍倩彤（Gillian）轉戰何文田，發掘一間主打精緻西式輕食的街角精品咖啡店。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">這間位於尖沙咀的餐廳是不少名人的飯堂，主打極具風味的避風塘菜式，必試招牌菜包括：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">避風塘興記</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址： 尖沙咀彌敦道180號寶華商業大廈1樓</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8262c16c-6096-403a-9b69-f81d16f12484.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026WiDLafqaRY1789095715.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8262c16c-6096-403a-9b69-f81d16f12484.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"efa80f23-b60a-412c-aa9c-fb3d76bbca6b.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026rN8HM2kEXH1789095717.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"efa80f23-b60a-412c-aa9c-fb3d76bbca6b.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7570c699-23d2-4f43-bbe3-d459fc2225e0.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026apgcfpbJTf1789095717.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7570c699-23d2-4f43-bbe3-d459fc2225e0.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3e826615-dab7-4029-ba86-11ea01f9dbea.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026YBWLw1F1SR1789095717.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3e826615-dab7-4029-ba86-11ea01f9dbea.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"32856211-c8a1-4805-ac48-3133cecd7d77.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026VuazuZ5nyo1789095716.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"32856211-c8a1-4805-ac48-3133cecd7d77.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">位於何文田梭椏道的這間精品咖啡店，堅持選用頂級食材，用心製作出多款份量與賣相兼備的西式輕食：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">Are U labeler</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址： 何文田梭椏道25A號地舖</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a94fcbe1-3e96-4717-986c-934ee640745e.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026pafXqeE3Km1789095719.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a94fcbe1-3e96-4717-986c-934ee640745e.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c918f6ee-5105-4c89-85e7-55762ebd2633.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026xMPwm9fNPs1789095718.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c918f6ee-5105-4c89-85e7-55762ebd2633.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block respo